Design a 1 Hz clock enable signal generator. The module counts clock cycles, and when it reaches 49,999,999 cycles, it asserts the output signal EN1HZ to indicate one second has passed. The counter resets either when the reset signal (RST) is asserted or when EN1HZ is high, ensuring that it operates accurately within a provided clock input (CLK).
