description:
Design a 32-bit binary up counter that increments its output by one on each rising edge of a 100 MHz clock signal. The counter resets to zero when the Reset signal is asserted low. The output is a 32-bit wide register, which allows for counting up to 2^32 - 1 before overflowing.
